   <section id="ch1">
    <title><p>Chapter 1</p><p>The Cold Press</p></title>
    <p>The press was cold that morning, and the type sat in its cases like rain waiting to fall. Nobody in the shop said a word about the proofs, which were late again.</p>
    <p>It was <emphasis>very</emphasis> cold, and <strong>nobody</strong> spoke.<a l:href="#n1" type="note">[1]</a></p>
